"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record from 1951 to 2025 shows August to September came in under 90% of normal in 38 of 75 years on the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids. In 2025 the middle ran 45% of normal for November to December. In 2026 the middle came in at 37% of normal for February to March and 162% for May to June.</p>"}
